sequenceDiagram
    participant API as ● Command API
    participant Broker as ◆ MQTT Broker
    participant Device as ▶ Device
    API->>Broker: Publish command (stable ID)
    Broker-->>API: PUBACK (broker accepted)
    Broker->>Device: Deliver command
    alt execution evidence received
        Device-->>API: Executed result
    else timeout
        Note over API,Device: Outcome unknown, reconcile before retry
    end
